   "name": "Rusland, USA og Ukraine",
   "section": "world",
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "Zelenskyj",
     "text": "Zelenskyj siger, at en ny europæisk sikkerhedsramme, som USA har luftet, kan gavne Putin.",
     "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPUW1pZDhVRDZHNFg1NmEtb2tWMVR0ZUVxS01NdUhkX1BlVTF1eG4yVVdFcGVLdWhTSWtmTUlSQ2NRNEpzZWJWWXVjazM2YmJyZjRndU1aM3BDcThWd2FqVElBT2s0bVZVeVpkVGFPeFZfTFZveGFCVWp2WE1QOUFyUVU4U2R0Z01jaWoyTkdvZWV1UElKSWllMnp3ZXA?oc=5",
     "source": "AP",
     "at": "2026-11-14T11:33:00+00:00",
     "added": "2026-11-14T12:03:25+00:00",
     "id": "da4235dd83edddbf",
     "kind": "s"
    },
    {
     "who": "Zelenskyj",
     "text": "USA har for første gang luftet ukrainsk Nato-medlemskab, hvis Ukraine opgiver Donbas.",
     "link": "https://www.dr.dk/nyheder/udland/zelenskyj-usa-har-aabnet-ukrainsk-nato-medlemsskab-men",
